      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GOOSEBUMPS RICO (6) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Irish Carla (24.55) in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Boasts a strong record from this draw with four wins and three minor placings from eight starts. Likely to feature again. COSMIC REWARD (7) finished well back at this track last time when a 3 length fifth (24.71) but scored five back at this track (24.53). Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from three attempts. Should be thereabouts. AUSSIE RAVEN (1) scored well last start as odds-on favourite by a neck at this track in a handy 28.70 beating Angelani. Well suited by the inside box and has a good record over this journey. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Should be in this for a long way. MCIVOR JEWELS (2) cannot be underestimated.",
